  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And we cwǽdon be uncuðum yrfe, þæt nan man næfde, buton hé hæbbe ðæs hundredesmanna gewitnyssa oððe ðæs teoðingmannes, ⁊ se sy wel getrýwe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">With regard to strange cattle, we have declared that no-one shall keep any such, except with the cognisance of the men of the hundred or that of the chief official of the tithing; and he must be a thoroughly trustworthy man.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et diximus de ignotis pecoribus, ut nemo habeat sine testimonio hominis hundredi uel hominum decime (decimalium), et hoc sit bene credibile.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
